{"code":"014285","name":"금강공업우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"건축제품","sector_desc":"창호·바닥재·설비 등 건축용 제품. 주택 착공·리모델링 경기를 따릅니다.","desc":"동사는 1979년 설립되어 1988년 유가증권시장에 상장한 강관 및 가설자재 종합 메이커임. 배관용·구조용 강관 제조 및 판매, 폼웍시스템 제조 및 임대업을 주력 사업으로 하고 있으며, 종속회사는 배합사료, 선박용 엔진밸브, 단조 제품 제조 및 판매를 운영하고 있음. 한국·베트남을 포함한 생산기지와 해외 사업 거점을 통해 글로벌 공급 체계를 구축하고, 알루미늄폼 임대사업과 AI 기반 스마트 제조로 원가 경쟁력 확보 중임.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":5370.0,"open":5300.0,"high":5370.0,"low":5250.0,"volume":299,"amount":1605630.0,"ret_1d":1.3208,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":2.2346,"ret_5":-0.1859,"ret_20":-5.291,"ret_60":2.8736,"ret_120":-23.6131,"ret_250":-34.5122,"ma20":5456.0,"ma60":5448.5,"ma120":5779.3333,"ma200":6450.05,"close_vs_ma200":-16.7448,"close_vs_ma60":-1.4408,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":5.0626,"r2_60":0.0101,"slope_120":-40.8246,"r2_120":0.5556,"slope_250":-48.296,"r2_250":0.7387,"high52":16500.0,"low52":5010.0,"pos_52w":3.1332,"dd_52w":-67.4545,"mdd_1y":-62.5641,"atr14_pct":3.4584,"vol_ann_60":62.4872,"vol_avg20":1095.05,"vol_ratio20":0.273,"vr5":0.1416,"vr20":0.4791,"amount_avg5":1109358.0,"amount_avg20":6031424.5,"amount_avg60":7731254.8333,"obv_chg20":30.2224,"turnover_20":3.7128,"pv_eff_20":-1.4251,"rsi14":48.2715,"frgn_net_5":-114.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0193,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0193,"frgn_net_20":-117.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0198,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0198,"frgn_net_60":32.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0054,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0054,"frgn_net_120":-2383.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.404,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.404,"foreign_ratio":0.41,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.01,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":180.0,"op_margin_q":7.8568,"op_qoq":36.3636,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":350.0,"rev_yoy":8.1681,"op_trend_4q":85.283,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-4.58,"debt_ratio":146.99,"per":null,"pbr":0.41,"div_yield":2.42,"foreign_rate":0.43,"tar